{"synopsis":"Min-su Lee adalah pemimpin tim ESG di konglomerat besar Soya Group. Wajahnya selalu datar, hidupnya sederhana, dan prinsipnya cuma satu: “Kerja boleh ribet, tapi pulang harus tepat waktu!”\n\nSayangnya, kedamaian itu buyar begitu Kang Chae-eun, putri bungsu sang ketua perusahaan, tiba-tiba masuk ke timnya. Sejak hari pertama, suasana jadi heboh—mulai dari drama politik kantor, rekan kerja tukang cari muka, sampai bos-bos yang hobi bikin masalah.\n\nTanpa mau, Min-su terseret ke pusaran intrik kantor yang absurd. Tapi di balik semua itu, tekadnya tetap sama:pulang kerja tepat waktu.\n\nApakah Min-su bisa mempertahankan mimpi sucinya untuk pulang kerja tepat waktu? Atau malah terjebak selamanya dalam drama kantor yang penuh gila-gilaan?","alternative_title":"오늘도 퇴근","author":"Parsher, White Grass","artist":"Underwater","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"7c8c4b83-dd32-4766-bc0b-0a0e46b9d8b1","number":"52","chapter":"52","title":"","date":"2026-07-29","released":"2026-07-29","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_9ad0275f-64d9-47a9-a7dc-e2793a95ff2f/chapter_ch_52/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_9ad0275f-64d9-47a9-a7dc-e2793a95ff2f/chapter_ch_52/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_9ad0275f-64d9-47a9-a7dc-e2793a95ff2f/chapter_ch_52/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_9ad0275f-64d9-47a9-a7dc-e2793a95ff2f/chapter_ch_52/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_9ad0275f-64d9-47a9-a7dc-e2793a95ff2f/chapter_ch_52/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_9ad0275f-64d9-47a9-a7dc-e2793a95ff2f/chapter_ch_52/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_9ad0275f-64d9-47a9-a7dc-e2793a95ff2f/chapter_ch_52/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_9ad0275f-64d9-47a9-a7dc-e2793a95ff2f/chapter_ch_52/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_9ad0275f-64d9-47a9-a7dc-e2793a95ff2f/chapter_ch_52/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_9ad0275f-64d9-47a9-a7dc-e2793a95ff2f/chapter_ch_52/10.webp","https://assets.sh